e genre's godmother. \"And a major pioneer was a woman named Sophie Zion, who found a way to combine pop aesthetics with various flavors of EDM.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The History of the 2010s Part 3: The New Genres","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tdTs-4Irv8c"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Modern Electronic Classic","body":"This album has, without a doubt, become a modern classic of electronic music. \"Este discazo se ha convertido, sin ningún tipo de duda, en un clásico moderno de la música electrónica.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Central Sonora","episode":"5 Discos Para Entrarle al HYPERPOP","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wP8MaC-2D8A"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Pioneering Pop Production","body":"Before this album, glitches and industrial production were not common in pop, but Sophie changed the rules of the game. \"Antes de este álbum, los glitches y la producción industrial no eran algo común en el pop, pero la artista cambió las reglas del juego.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Central Sonora","episode":"5 Discos Para Entrarle al HYPERPOP","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wP8MaC-2D8A"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":203395464334437,"type":"album","name":"My World","list_id":113605775141787,"list":"RYM Top — Electronic — Eurobeat","src":"musthear","rank":49,"year":1989,"note":null,"yt":"21n9ytUlieY","scaruffi":null},{"id":93383076639714,"type":"album","name":"Tales to Tell","list_id":113605775141787,"list":"RYM Top — Electronic — Eurobeat","src":"musthear","rank":141,"year":1989,"note":null,"yt":"YhQclNnxEcI","scaruffi":null},{"id":137727448033801,"type":"album","name":"The Only Reason","list_id":113605775141787,"list":"RYM Top — Electronic — Eurobeat","src":"musthear","rank":52,"year":1991,"note":null,"yt":"0rTSFzM-3Hw","scaruffi":null},{"id":280779358484858,"type":"album","name":"Stop the Music\nストップ・ザ・ミュージックノソフ